S. Virgin Islands, and Guam. Among other activities,&nbsp;the institutes plan and conduct research to improve water supply reliability and address water problems.</p>","updateDate":"2026-09-11T20:17:53Z","versionCode":"07"}],"title":"AWRC Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-22T19:25:51Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-22T19:25:51Z"}
